      "reason": "Equivalent private planning-record mutability: _DirectorySources is constructed with all fields, stored in a private ContextVar, read by directory parsing and module ID planning, and reset in finally. directory_sources yields None rather than exposing the record. No consumer rebinds its fields or hashes, serializes, or compares the record. Mutable nested maps remain equally mutable under either decorator. Re-reviewed against the current source and graph callers during exception-evidence review preparation; public NativeGrammar immutability remains separately tested and is not exempted."
