      "reason": "Equivalent private resolution-record mutability: _Resolution is constructed with graph, imports, locals, declarations and root; consumers read its fields or mutate the referenced graph. Updates use dataclasses.replace to construct another record, not field rebinding. It is neither returned by the parser nor hashed, serialized, or compared. Re-reviewed against current resolver callers; the frozen-field guard has no observable parser effect."
