      "reason": "Equivalent for parser-produced call and trait locations: a location starts at an expression or trait token, never the opening-brace token of the declaration's enclosing block. Equality with that enclosing block's start_point cannot occur. Removing equality at the lower bound therefore changes no resolver decision. The closing bound and other comparisons remain gated; arbitrary manually fabricated locations passed to this private helper are outside this exception."
